OL,3,GNEWSALabour's Lucy Powell questioned on
OL,4,Acouncil reforms, vocational GCSEs and
OL,5,Awelfare on BBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour's deputy leader Lucy Powell is
OL,8,Ftaking part in a series of quick-fire
OL,9,Finterviews on BBC local radio stations
OL,10,F- watch live above
OL,12,FHer party is preparing to host its
OL,13,Fautumn conference, which takes place in
OL,14,FLiverpool from Sunday
OL,16,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,17,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,18,Fyears. Leaders of the Conservatives,
OL,19,FGreens, Lib Dems and Reform UK are
OL,20,Fgetting a similar opportunity before
OL,21,Ftheir conferences
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
